00:35:54,210 --> 00:35:56,980
加入一些像RNA或者DNA的东西,
and put something in like RNA or DNA,

678
00:35:56,980 --> 00:35:58,880
不过我们思考的是更原始简单的东西,
but we're thinking of more primitive ways

679
00:35:58,880 --> 00:36:02,520
来了解遗传信息是如何产生的.
of understanding the emergence of information.

680
00:36:02,520 --> 00:36:04,290
弗里曼：Martin还在研究
Freeman: Martin is still working

681
00:36:04,290 --> 00:36:07,190
产生遗传信息的方法,
on recipes for inheritable information,

682
00:36:07,190 --> 00:36:09,160
他正站在创造
and he's on the brink

683
00:36:09,160 --> 00:36:11,990
活的有机体和无生命材料的边缘.
of creating a living organism from nonliving materials.

684
00:36:13,600 --> 00:36:14,730
如果有条界线,
If there is a line

685
00:36:14,730 --> 00:36:16,700
划分生命和非生命系统,
between the living and nonliving systems,

686
