这个这条界线肯定是很模糊的.
then it must be a very blurry line.

687
00:36:22,040 --> 00:36:26,010
弗里曼：从人工细胞到人工神经元,
Freeman: From artificial cells to artificial neurons,

688
00:36:26,010 --> 00:36:30,280
科学家们正在用他们的双手创造新生命,
scientists are creating new life with their own hands,

689
00:36:30,280 --> 00:36:32,350
但一位前物理学家
but one former physicist

690
00:36:32,350 --> 00:36:35,350
认为另一种版本的生命正在形成,
thinks there could be another version of life arising,

691
00:36:35,350 --> 00:36:38,550
生长于全人类的
growing out of the collective experience

692
00:36:38,560 --> 00:36:40,760
集体经验之中.
of all of humanity.

693
00:36:43,860 --> 00:36:45,600
地球生命起始于
Life on earth began

694
00:36:45,600 --> 00:36:48,670
原始生物池中一个泡泡的
as a simple cycle of chemical reactions

695
00:36:48,670 --> 00:36:51,470
化学反应的简单循环.
in a bubbling,primordial pond.

696
00:36:51,770 --> 00:36:54,370
四十亿年后,
Four billion years later,

697
00:36:54,370 --> 00:36:57,840
这些化学反应散布到了整个星球,
those chemical reactions have spread across the planet

698
00:36:57,840 --> 00:37:00,110
而且变得如此复杂,
and have become so complex

699
00:37:00,110 --> 00:37:04,510
复杂到可以思考交谈,就像我,
that they can think and talk,like me,

700
00:37:04,520 --> 00:37:07,050
但有些新东西正在萌发.
but something new is happening.

701
00:37:07,050 --> 00:37:11,520
电脑之间的联系已经扩散到全世界,
Connections between computers have spread worldwide,

702
00:37:11,520 --> 00:37:14,460
形成了一个致密的电子网络,
forming a dense electronic web,

703
00:37:14,460 --> 00:37:20,700
现在这些全球网络-- 一个是电子的,一个是化学的--
and now these global networks -- one electronic,one chemical --

704
00:37:20,700 --> 00:37:22,670
正在相互影响.
are interacting.

705
00:37:22,670 --> 00:37:25,800
一个新生命即将出现,
A new life could be about to begin

706
00:37:25,800 --> 00:37:30,640
它不像我们知道的地球上的任何尺度的东西.
on a scale unlike anything earth has ever known.

707
00:37:34,110 --> 00:37:37,110
进化控制论学家Francis Heylighen
Evolutionary cyberneticist Francis Heylighen

708
00:37:37,120 --> 00:37:39,080
就职于布鲁塞尔自由大学,
at the free University of Brussels

709
00:37:39,080 --> 00:37:45,320
他认为人类正在酝酿一个孩子,这个孩子非常巨大.
thinks humanity is giving birth,and this baby is big.

710
00:37:45,320 --> 00:37:47,760
Heylighen: 如果我们来看全球社会,
Heylighen: If we look at global society,

711
00:37:47,760 --> 00:37:50,990
这颗星球上的七十亿人,
at all the seven billion people on this planet,

712
00:37:51,000 --> 00:37:55,230
人们越来越紧密的联系成为了一个连贯的整体.
people become more and more connected into a coherent being.

713
00:37:57,840 --> 00:37:59,940
互联网可立即为你提供
The Internet gives you immediate access

714
00:37:59,940 --> 00:38:02,010
所有的重要想法.
to all the important ideas.

715
00:38:02,010 --> 00:38:05,380
今日,许多想法可以横跨大洋,
Nowadays,ideas travel the ocean.

716
00:38:05,380 --> 00:38:07,940
它们可以近乎光速传递.
They can do that with almost the speed of light.

717
00:38:07,950 --> 00:38:09,810
这意味着思想传递的速度
That means the speed is comparable

718
00:38:09,810 --> 00:38:12,120
相当于我们互相交谈时
to the speed that the neurons in our brain use

719
00:38:12,120 --> 00:38:13,880
脑中神经传递的速度.
to talk to each other.

720
00:38:16,350 --> 00:38:18,620
弗里曼：全球网络联系了我们所有人,
Freeman: The global network that connects all of us

721
00:38:18,620 --> 00:38:22,160
促使了大量的信息共享,
facilitates massive amounts of information sharing,

722
00:38:22,160 --> 00:38:24,990
揭开解释
information that has unveiled secrets

723
00:38:25,000 --> 00:38:28,000
我们宇宙如何工作奥秘的信息.
that explain how our universe works.

724
00:38:28,000 --> 00:38:31,600
比如,CERN的大型强子对撞机,
The Large Hadron Collider at Cern,for example,

725
00:38:31,600 --> 00:38:34,800
发现了行踪不明的希格斯玻色子,
could not have detected the elusive Higgs boson

726
00:38:34,810 --> 00:38:37,770
而这一发现需要以极快的速度在全球传递
without the ability to share tremendous amounts of data

727
00:38:37,780 --> 00:38:40,640
分享大量数据信息的能力.
across the globe at great speeds.

728
00:38:44,080 --> 00:38:46,880
Heylighen: 如果伽利略可以直接
Heylighen: If Galileo could immediately have talked

729
00:38:46,890 --> 00:38:48,750
和他所有的同行交流,
with all his colleagues,

730
00:38:48,750 --> 00:38:52,890
我确信科学的发展会更为迅速.
I'm sure that science would've developed much more quickly.

731
00:38:55,960 --> 00:38:57,990
弗里曼：Francis和他的计算机科学家团队
Freeman: Francis and his team of computer scientists

732
00:38:58,000 --> 00:39:00,630
发明了一个数学模型
have invented a mathematical model

733
00:39:00,630 --> 00:39:02,970
可以测量互联网在做什么.
to measure what the Internet is doing.

734
00:39:02,970 --> 00:39:05,440
他们的目标就是要找出
Their goal is to find out

735
00:39:05,440 --> 00:39:08,610
网络是否形成了一个全球脑.
whether it is becoming a global brain.

736
00:39:08,610 --> 00:39:12,680
Heylighen: 在数学模型中,就像所有的科学模型,
Heylighen: In the mathematical model,like in all scientific models,

737
00:39:12,680 --> 00:39:15,010
你将实际情况简化,
you make a kind of simplification of reality.

738
00:39:15,010 --> 00:39:16,950
你不需要一个真人,
Instead of having a real person,

739
00:39:16,950 --> 00:39:19,380
只需要一个小的电脑程序
you will have a small computer program

740
