在某种方式上表现得像一个真人.
that in some way behaves like a real person.

741
00:39:24,560 --> 00:39:27,620
弗里曼：Francis的模型像是全球规模的功能磁共振成像,
Freeman: Francis' models are like global fMRIs,

742
00:39:27,630 --> 00:39:31,360
这里人们的行为就像一个巨型脑中的神经元.
where people act like the neurons in a giant brain.

743
00:39:33,260 --> 00:39:36,200
就像神经元通过不断被刺激进行学习,
Just as neurons learn by firing back and forth,

744
00:39:36,200 --> 00:39:40,670
人们通过电子手段激起信息的传递.
people fire information to one another electronically.

745
00:39:40,670 --> 00:39:43,770
Francis认为随着人们之间联接的
Francis believes as connections between people

746
00:39:43,780 --> 00:39:45,270
增加与加强,
increase in number and strength,

747
00:39:45,280 --> 00:39:48,510
我们全球脑会越来越智能.
our global brain will become more intelligent.

748
00:39:48,510 --> 00:39:49,680
嗯.
Hmm.

749
00:39:51,520 --> 00:39:54,680
Heylighen: 你可以看到连接网络--
Heylighen: You see that the network of connections --

750
00:39:54,690 --> 00:39:57,590
它需要做什么时就会做得更好.
it's getting better at what it needs to do.

751
00:39:57,590 --> 00:39:59,290
新的连接被创造,
New connections are created,

752
00:39:59,290 --> 00:40:03,490
没用的旧连接消失,
old connections that are no longer useful disappear,

753
00:40:03,500 --> 00:40:06,030
所有的东西都是在不断地自组织.
and the whole thing is constantly self-organizing.

754
00:40:06,030 --> 00:40:09,300
弗里曼：Francis的工作显示
Freeman: Francis' work has shown him

755
00:40:09,300 --> 00:40:12,800
我们的全球脑正在适应、学习.
that our global brain is adapting,learning.

756
00:40:12,800 --> 00:40:16,040
人类和网络正在融合,
Humanity and the Internet are merging

757
00:40:16,040 --> 00:40:19,210
成为一个巨大的活的东西.
to become a giant,living being.

758
00:40:21,380 --> 00:40:24,650
他把这个全球生命的开始和
He compares this beginning of global life

759
00:40:24,650 --> 00:40:25,980
她9岁大的女儿--
to the beginning of life

760
00:40:25,980 --> 00:40:28,790
Nia生命的开始做了比较.
for his 9-year-old daughter,Nia.

761
00:40:30,120 --> 00:40:33,620
这是Nia还在子宫中的图片.
This is a picture of Nia in the womb.

762
00:40:33,630 --> 00:40:35,790
她有最基本的脑,
She had a rudimentary brain,

763
00:40:35,790 --> 00:40:38,160
但是这个脑基本上只是一堆细胞,
but the brain was basically a bunch of cells.

764
00:40:38,160 --> 00:40:40,830
它们之间没有联系--
There was no interconnection --

765
00:40:40,830 --> 00:40:44,900
经年累月的学习和经验
learning and experiencing over the months and the years

766
00:40:44,900 --> 00:40:47,900
最后形成了正确的联接.
to find what are the right connections.

767
00:40:47,910 --> 00:40:50,440
她开始只是一堆细胞,
She started out as this bunch of cells,

768
00:40:50,440 --> 00:40:54,910
但后来她逐渐发育成一个聪明智慧
but then she gradually developed into a smart,intelligent,

769
00:40:54,910 --> 00:40:59,020
喜欢冒险的小女孩,比如喜欢爬树.
adventurous little girl that likes to climb in trees.

770
00:41:00,920 --> 00:41:03,290
弗里曼：Nia身体中的单个细胞
Freeman: A single cell in Nia's body

771
