并不知道它自己要干嘛.
doesn't know what to do on its own.

772
00:41:06,320 --> 00:41:07,890
这是她脑中
It is the coordinated effort

773
00:41:07,890 --> 00:41:09,990
亿万个神经元协调工作的结果,
of the billions of neurons in her brain

774
00:41:09,990 --> 00:41:13,760
告诉她的腿部肌肉如何稳定在树干上,
that tells her leg muscles how to climb a tree trunk

775
00:41:13,770 --> 00:41:15,130
并告诉她的手臂肌肉
and tells her arm muscles

776
00:41:15,130 --> 00:41:18,000
如何让她从一个树枝到另一个树枝.
how to propel herself from branch to branch.

777
00:41:19,200 --> 00:41:21,840
Francis认为人类和网络
Francis believes humans and the web

778
00:41:21,840 --> 00:41:23,940
也以相同的方式共同工作.
are working together in the same way.

779
00:41:25,440 --> 00:41:27,640
如果生命起始于脑,
If life begins with a brain,

780
00:41:27,650 --> 00:41:32,480
那么人类刚刚爬到意识的一个新层次.
then humanity has just climbed to a new level of awareness.

781
00:41:33,950 --> 00:41:36,950
Heylighen: 这是全球水平
Heylighen: It is the beginning of consciousness

782
00:41:36,960 --> 00:41:38,550
意识的开始,
at the global level

783
00:41:38,560 --> 00:41:41,360
我们看到它从互联网中产生,
that we see with the emergence of the Internet.

784
00:41:41,360 --> 00:41:44,690
这也算是一类生命的起始.
So,it is a kind of a beginning of life.

785
00:41:44,700 --> 00:41:47,300
弗里曼：一个活着的人类不能失去脑,
Freeman: A human being cannot survive without a brain,

786
