一个脑也不能没有躯体而存活,
a brain cannot survive without a body,

787
00:41:51,140 --> 00:41:54,300
现在人类这个躯体和网络这个脑
and now the body of humanity and the brain of the web

788
00:41:54,310 --> 00:41:58,780
也许正在产生一个超智能生物体.
may be evolving into a superintelligent organism.

789
00:41:59,980 --> 00:42:03,110
这会是新的生命形式的产生吗？
Could it be the beginning of a new form of life？

790
00:42:04,880 --> 00:42:07,180
生命何时才算开始？
When does life begin？

