00:42:11,190 --> 00:42:12,790
这个问题的几个答案.
to this question.

793
00:42:12,790 --> 00:42:15,530
当精卵细胞融合时,
When sperm and egg meet,

794
00:42:15,530 --> 00:42:18,900
它们创造了新的独特的遗传蓝图.
they create a new and unique genetic blueprint.

795
00:42:18,900 --> 00:42:23,830
当生物变得有意识时,生命又往前跨了一步,
Life takes another leap forward when creatures become conscious,

796
00:42:23,840 --> 00:42:27,300
他们可能是婴儿、小孩,或机器人.
be they babies,toddlers,or robots.

797
00:42:27,310 --> 00:42:31,110
当所有的这些生命个体融合到一起,
And when all those individual life-forms merge,

798
00:42:31,110 --> 00:42:34,810
成为了全球超个体的一部分,
becoming part of a global superorganism,

799
00:42:34,810 --> 00:42:38,250
地球上的生命则又向前迈了一步,
life on earth will advance one more step,

800
00:42:38,250 --> 00:42:41,120
也许有一天,
and perhaps,one day,

801
00:42:41,120 --> 00:42:45,920
这个新型生命会问：生命从哪里开始,
that new life-form will ask where its life began

802
00:42:45,920 --> 00:42:49,590
还会有什么样的生命奇迹尚未诞生.
and what miracles are yet to be born.

